Package: stageaware
Type: Package
Title: Stage-Aware Follow-Up Designs for Definitive Screening Experiments
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lunganlung", "P. G.", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lunganlungpg@users.noreply.github.com"),
    person("Prabhakar", "Verma", role = "aut"))
Description: Exact stage-adjusted criteria, stage-confounding diagnostics,
    rank-completion run counts and coordinate exchange with a centred rank-two
    update for choosing follow-up runs after a definitive screening design when
    the combined analysis includes a fixed stage effect. Base R only.
